      <TmpImage src={multiporWestFinishingPaintedImage} alt="The painted west wall."/>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-20">
    <h2 class="text-3xl">Interlude: cleaning up the subfloor substructure</h2>
    <div class="mt-5">
      <p>We built the subfloor substructure far earlier than necessary. Result: tons of construction waste accumulating around and under the substructure, which needed to be cleaned up before installing the subfloor.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-8">
      <TmpImage src={subfloorCleanupDustpanImage} alt="Lost of construction waste accumulated under and around the subfloor substructure."/>
