    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-20">
    <h2 class="text-3xl">Installing the OSB subfloor</h2>
    <div class="mt-5">
      <p>We used a single layer of 22 mm (a bit under 1 inch) tongue and groove OSB for the subfloor. 
      The sleepers in the subfloor substructure an spaced to match the factor dimensions of the OSB boards.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-8">
      <TmpImage src={subfloorFirstBoardsImage} alt="Test-fitting the first few subfloor boards."/>
