      <TmpImage src={sheathingCompleteImage} alt="The completed sheathing of the main partition wall."/>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-20">
    <h2 class="text-3xl">Insulating the main partition wall</h2>
    <div class="mt-5">
      <p>We insulated the main partition wall between the finished living space and the rest of the unfinished attic with glass wool placed between the wall studs.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-8">
